<section
  id="top"
  class="relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-[clamp(5rem,9vw,7rem)] before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:inset-0 before:z-0 before:content-[''] before:bg-hero-halo"
>
  <div class="relative z-[1] mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] md:gap-14">
    <div>
      <p class="text-[0.8rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent-strong">AI First Company · 灵栈平云</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl text-[2.5rem] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] text-text-strong md:text-[4.25rem] md:leading-[1.05]">
        信任优先，<br />构建 AI 时代的<br />真实能力。
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-[1.75] text-text-muted md:text-xl">
        EvoniaAI 帮助全球客户构建世界级 AI Agents 与 AI Platforms，把先进技术落到可运行、可信任、可持续演进的业务系统里。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-text-strong px-5 py-[0.8rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.005em] text-text-on-strong transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-px hover:bg-text-strong-hover hover:no-underline"
          href="#contact"
        >启动合作</a>
        <a
          class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border bg-surface/76 px-5 py-[0.8rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.005em] text-text-strong transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-px hover:border-border-hover hover:bg-surface hover:no-underline"
          href="#projects"
        >查看公开项目</a>
      </div>
      <dl class="mt-10 grid max-w-[35rem] grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-border pt-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] tabular-nums text-accent-strong">Trust</dt>
          <dd class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text-strong">信任优先</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] tabular-nums text-accent-strong">Global</dt>
          <dd class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text-strong">全球视野</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <dt class="text-[0.6875rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] tabular-nums text-accent-strong">Dignity</dt>
          <dd class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text-strong">技术与尊严</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-panel border border-border p-[clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.5rem)] shadow-card bg-hero-panel after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:-right-20 after:-top-20 after:h-[260px] after:w-[260px] after:rounded-full after:opacity-35 after:blur-[60px] after:content-[''] after:bg-hero-glow"
    >
      <div class="relative z-[1] flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <img src="/logo.svg" alt="EvoniaAI logo" class="h-20 w-20 rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-sm" />
        <span class="rounded-full bg-accent-soft px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.6875rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent-strong">AI First</span>
      </div>
      <p class="relative z-[1] mt-8 text-[0.8125rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent-strong">Trust · Global · Dignity</p>
      <h2 class="relative z-[1] mt-3 text-[1.375rem] font-bold leading-[1.25] text-text-strong md:text-[1.625rem]">
        我们相信技术与尊严可以让世界更好。
      </h2>
      <p class="relative z-[1] mt-3 max-w-md leading-[1.75] text-text-muted">
        AI 不应该只带来更快的自动化，也应该带来更清晰的责任、更好的协作，以及更值得信任的产品体验。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
